sl02_umah_01 "umah"
kain - do not be afraid.

sl02_kain_01 "kain"
hah - what magic is this?

sl02_umah_02 "umah"
i am using the whisper, kain, a natural ability of vampires. in this way, we can keep in contact even over great distances.

sl02_kain_02 "kain"
yes, i remember now.

sl02_kain_03 "kain"
she had been in my thoughts. i almost believed i had called her myself.

sl02_umah_03 "umah"
never fear, i cannot read your thoughts, but only speak into your mind, and hear you in return. now, proceed down this street. i shall be waiting.

slam_mfn01_01 "man"
they're here to protect us, that's why.

slam_ffn01_01 "woman"
then why so many?

slam_mfn01_02 "man"
well, we need a great deal of protection. the seraphan have sworn to protect the people and destroy the vampire menace.

slam_ffn01_02 "woman"
have you ever seen a vampire?

slam_mfn01_03 "man"
exactly. they've kept their promise.

slam_ffn01_03 "woman"
i'll tell you what else they've kept - our tax money, that's what.

slam_mfn01_04 "man"
hush that talk. someone may hear you.

